# Banglar Voice — Git LFS tracking (repo is PRIVATE; LFS is enabled for future large media).
# No .apk/.aab are tracked in git (CI builds them and uploads to GitHub Releases).
# No large binaries are tracked today — these patterns are reserved so that if a large
# binary is ever added deliberately, it goes through LFS instead of bloating the repo.
#*.apk filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#*.aab filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.zip filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.tar.gz filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
